			<div class="content" id="post-content-3886221">
									

<p>My attempt at a Nazi SCP, for the SCP-4000 contest. This article is not for the faint of heart</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;The&nbsp;hook:</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;There's&nbsp;nothing&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;make&nbsp;up&nbsp;about&nbsp;the&nbsp;Nazis&nbsp;that's&nbsp;scarier&nbsp;than&nbsp;what&nbsp;they&nbsp;were&nbsp;planning&nbsp;to&nbsp;do&nbsp;in&nbsp;real&nbsp;life.</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>This was painful to write, but I felt I had to. A few articles of ours, such as <a href="/scp-1939">SCP-1939</a>, have explored the potentialities of a Nazi victory in what-if form. However, I feel that none have done so in a way that truly exposes the inhumanity and sheer senseless bloodlust of National Socialist doctrine. I understand if this is too much from people, but know that I, like the author of the work which compelled me to write this, intended for this to be a thorough examination and complete denunciation of Nazi ideology. If this horrifies you, keep in mind that I didn't make any of these plans up.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Inspired by <a href="https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Literature/TheAngloAmericanNaziWar?from=Main.AngloAmericanNaziWar">The Anglo/American Nazi War</a>.</p>

							</div>

								
					
